{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "893777322f253e46f3c4b07b7b462f35574139d385f851e9c431369594af1d43", "ja": "あっ、いたいた。よかったー。\n{$P$}さーんっ！", "zh": "啊，原来在这，太好了～\n{$P$}先生──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e5cff9703ab42a18bb64a7109ab17e56f9963d0016e6464233002d0fd74a2dfc", "ja": "青羽さん。どうかしましたか？", "zh": "青羽小姐，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "ff137d8b5050c8b105e2c1a3d2c1ddd69ce667f889e25e1bcac3de8dab39eedf", "ja": "社長さんがお呼びです。\nまたお話ししたいことがあるそうですよ。", "zh": "社长在找你，\n似乎又有什么事想找你谈喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "35b53f2ee66fe8c321bb433df976a7baa4a74947bd5b142bc6104a68cc715bf9", "ja": "そうでしたか。\n今回は何の話でしょうね？", "zh": "这样啊。\n不晓得这次会是什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "847df92600df4ac41c0c207e5c3abf5ac6c2ade4136e9b4c5fcf0a9b21cbcf3c", "ja": "ふふっ、それは行ってみてのお楽しみです♪\nでも、きっといいお話だと思いますよ～。", "zh": "呵呵，这就要去了才知道啰♪\n但我猜肯定是好消息～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b264e2e92758c54ec6cd2a63dbc231842637081e5d08fa610c15aa2af16546b6", "ja": "はは、なるほど。わかりました。\nそれじゃ、早速行ってきますね！", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。\n我明白了，那我马上过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "cb2f57041403c70058d9ee873d6e8186a2c5cc8af7433443eb79ae0a674fff9a", "ja": "はいっ、頑張ってくださいね！\n行ってらっしゃ～い♪", "zh": "好的，要加油喔！\n请慢走～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1007_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1008_101kot", "source_sha256": "9a35397f0db86d7e725ebd481a696cb2792c5fcbe57dcedc8fba17ee02d8d278", "ja": "はぁ。世間はすっかり春よね～。\n私のところには、いつ春が来てくれるのかしら……。", "zh": "唉，都已经春满人间了呢～\n我的春天什么时候才会来啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1009_101kot", "source_sha256": "48df917fcb920cf96f30a7b1171835b01f6b23ed9fdef78c86c6cfc14b32b861", "ja": "フンフフフーンフーン♪　フンフフフーンフーン♪\nフンフンフーン♪　フフーン♪", "zh": "哼哼哼哼～哼～♪哼哼哼哼～哼～♪\n哼哼哼～♪哼哼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f873ff3d6028dc7faf4039e06852e27429f7dd6c1bc81812dce2cac7672c8b5c", "ja": "失礼します。\n音無さん、お疲れ様です！", "zh": "打扰了。\n音无小姐，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "7e3d5cacf0153b94fa6d4c832dca4436bf5c19daeade8c79d31fb52c69e04c35", "ja": "はっ、{$P$}さん！？\nこんなタイミングで現れるだなんて……。", "zh": "哇，{$P$}先生！？\n你居然正巧在这个时机出现……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "a761c40a231e8e30342e737344c1ba7db7eb710c57ed5bf84a7abfbe5ab81cbc", "ja": "もしかして、私の春って……私の春って……！？", "zh": "难道我的春天……我的春天是……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "fbc03b10686ddf5e785f4ddc8e69209f3f747a0886233a5f6c2b3b1ce74ab6be", "ja": "春がどうかしましたか？", "zh": "春天怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "df97cd928049eb7c1a2f3307b64e301ed6920f9d114d4942a6463b42bd5111a4", "ja": "あっ。……ご、ごめんなさい！\nなんでもありません、なんでもっ。うふ、うふふ♪", "zh": "啊……对、对不起！\n没啦，没什么事，呵、呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "7f97572b42235bca97d733c54bc37808e2dae6ae7a7644439711fc56746bbefe", "ja": "そんなことより、社長がお待ちかねですよ！\nそれはもうビックリするほど！　ねっ、社長！？", "zh": "不说这个了，社长都快等不及了！\n那可是惊天动地的大消息！对吧，社长！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "935eccb39423e7cddd2e10bba8062dd79adbb428c21915b15ad24ee882f8aaaf", "ja": "う、うむ、よく来てくれたね！　君に早く伝えたい話が\nあって、年甲斐もなくうずうずしていたところだよ！", "zh": "嗯，是嘛，你来了啊！我有件事想快点告诉你，\n瞧我都一把年纪了还这么按捺不住！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "20b5218ac0b3505897e9c6671485956132ceade1dc3ed1736238387a2f69111d", "ja": "とはいえ、音無君が言っていたほどかは、\nちょっと自信がない気もするが……まあいい。", "zh": "话虽如此，有没有音无说得那么夸张，\n我倒是有点没信心……算了，无所谓。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "7a2cb3c35d522fc01769bf2e33ccdea688014789430d76c26bdd62c77754847f", "ja": "（どうやらいいニュースみたいだな。\nいったい何だろう……！）", "zh": "（看来是要跟我说好消息。\n到底会是什么事呢……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "c137a2b06df9d28de991f0ff178075af65449c4b7e2332b849a6ae6780d29a93", "ja": "うおっほん！　それでは発表しよう。", "zh": "咳咳！那就来公布吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "7215f139000c38e2673d23ef24270bd515658aa5ae69bc46e273353b9704233b", "ja": "先日、田中琴葉君が劇場に合流してくれたのは、\n君も知ってのとおりだが……。", "zh": "田中琴叶在前些日子加入剧场，\n这件事你应该也知道吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "2089973161491294ebdc3481206ff7e86b9f219d8d63aaa6ed3cf90afe9057a8", "ja": "今回は、その琴葉君を含む5人のアイドルで\n新しいユニットを結成しようと考えていてね。", "zh": "其实我想安排五位偶像，\n来共同组成新团体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "31f682a589924c4c83add778de1633350f31f88c27705bcbee9335e4360130f7", "ja": "新ユニット、ですか……！\nでは、残りのメンバーは？", "zh": "新团体是吗……！\n那么，其他成员有谁呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "6ad949ec7783119f9cb99d9cdc968a7659b06855f3dd3e4f7914d9e159d2b9d6", "ja": "うむ。所恵美君。高坂海美君。\nそして大神環君と宮尾美也君だ。", "zh": "嗯，有田中琴叶、所惠美、高坂海美，\n还有大神环跟宫尾美也。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "6afc9b998a76eee091417055bede12c3b3829effa8d813330cc381f911cff30c", "ja": "この5人に組んでもらうユニットの名前。それは……。\n『灼熱少女（バーニングガール）』！", "zh": "这五个人组成的团体名称呢，就叫做……\n『灼热少女（Burning Girl）』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "f15671d6c2d445d447222912ca3fedbe417cde88339dd6794629264972edf61f", "ja": "バ……『灼熱少女』！？", "zh": "灼……『灼热少女』！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "54bc0c6b018baaaedbc2638492693e8369d22ddccd925694b2288d3f2b3ef423", "ja": "そうだ！　アイドルに青春を燃やす彼女たちに\nぴったりのユニット名だと思わないかね？", "zh": "没错！她们为了偶像星路燃烧青春，\n你不觉得这个团体名称非常适合她们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "c746190bbb8e8cd0772215676762617f0ef1d7f7362b8b73d4101f185c3a7135", "ja": "ふふふっ。社長、このユニット名が\nずいぶんお気に入りみたいですよ。", "zh": "呵呵呵，\n社长好像非常中意这个团体名称喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "b541f317446e259a67b9675a2e630188c7614cdab4af40d1c4cd2ac62cf33f6a", "ja": "（早く言いたくてうずうずしてたっていうのは\nこれだったのか……。だが、確かに）", "zh": "（社长迫不及待想告诉我的就是这件事啊……\n不过，他说得没错。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "55d4ae4292392b45e97fdf60f4d083a86ba1e55d2e866aa242d3455f79be2b51", "ja": "いいユニット名だと思います。\nみんなの情熱、きっとファンにも伝わるでしょう。", "zh": "我认为这个团体名称很棒。\n粉丝一定也能感受到她们的热情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "52b47602098b9cdd9218f360c475e1f3ae1431550a37194a6295007f82e1ce70", "ja": "君ならそう言ってくれると思っていたよ！\nさて、この灼熱少女のプロデュースだが……。", "zh": "我就知道你会这么说！\n那么，『灼热少女』的培育……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_1031", "source_sha256": "1328858b72076382b4434a1d60241e572fa393e0e21d8022ddd6bd6bcd0ca477", "ja": "任せてください！", "zh": "请交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "752050f20faed18b821c3e589898148bfc09a6ba9b9f9b76ccc53acd12b295f1", "ja": "ぜひ、任せてください。灼熱少女の公演、\nきっと成功させてみせます！", "zh": "请务必交给我。\n我一定会让『灼热少女』的公演成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "5cfe44a053c2865b1fa84feec47298025c4a6ffb771ff2887d9185bdf714bb62", "ja": "はっはっは、自ら引き受けてくれるとは頼もしい！\nでは決まりだね。ひとつ、よろしく頼むよ！", "zh": "哈哈哈，你自愿接下这份工作真是可靠！\n那就决定这么办，万事拜托啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_2002_president", "source_sha256": "afdcc39e2fb11cfa9cddb6b2f54de1cc4c9fbd2f0618a3a2ab886ed830608f12", "ja": "リーダーは、琴葉君に任せるのがいいだろう。\nどんな公演になるか、楽しみにさせてもらうよ！", "zh": "队长就交由琴叶担任吧。\n她们会呈现出什么样的公演，我拭目以待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_2003_101kot", "source_sha256": "4fd5b7cea42dfc7b3553da986b2d1fc39d70f4e403307e3423b3e2a3d25f8478", "ja": "私も楽しみです♪　{$P$}さん、\nみんなに、熱い情熱の春を届けてあげてくださいね！", "zh": "我也会拭目以待♪{$P$}先生，\n请为大家带来一场灼热的热情之春吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
