{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_intro_2005_p", "source_sha256": "c67efc0f99b3054e8e3afa10de4fa129702239848ae1ac0106a8aa9cca43a9f7", "ja": "（琴葉がリーダーか。\nまじめでしっかり者の琴葉なら、確かに適任だろう）", "zh": "（由琴叶担任队长吗？\n认真可靠的琴叶确实很适合当队长。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
